WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.991
The inner query returns patient IDs from Cardiology
admissions The

00:00:06.005 --> 00:00:11.598
outer query keeps patients whose patient ID appears
in that set This

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:17.284
is a natural use of IN because the business question
is membership Run

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:21.547
the query and connect each returned patient with the
Cardiology admissions table
